{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45580","headline":"古意九首 一 · 贯休","name":"古意九首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一雨火云尽，闭门心冥冥。\n兰花与芙蓉，满院同芳馨。\n佳人天一涯，好鸟何嘤嘤。\n我有双白璧，不羡于虞卿。\n我有径寸珠，别是天地精。\n玩之室生白，潇洒身安轻。\n只应天上人，见我双眼明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}